# 🎤 OPIc Experience Question - Day32

## Question

Tell me about a memorable experience you had recently.

---

## Speaking Mission

Speak for 60–90 seconds.

Include:

- When it happened
- Where you were
- Who you were with
- What happened
- How you felt
- How it ended

---

## Challenge

Start with:

> I remember when...

Also try to use:

> At first,...

> Then,...

> I felt...

> In the end,...

---

## Recommended Structure

I remember when...

↓

It happened when...

↓

I was with...

↓

At first,...

↓

Then,...

↓

I felt...

↓

In the end,...
